  "question": {
    "html": "<p>An electron moves with speed v in a region of a uniform magnetic field of strength <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"B\"></span>. The path of the electron is a circle of radius R. The graph shows how R varies with v.</p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p><br/>What is the gradient of the graph?</p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{m_{e}B}{e}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{eB}{m_{e}}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{m_{e}}{eB}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{e}{m_{e}B}\"></span></li></ol>"
  },
